          <item><widget class="QLabel" name="measurementHintLabel"><property name="text"><string>Widths are outer semi-widths in the output layer local CRS. RNAV 5 uses ±5.77 NM, not ±5 NM. To verify: set the project CRS to the output layer CRS, select Cartesian measurement and snap perpendicular to the track. UTM Cartesian and WGS84 ellipsoidal measurements may differ.</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item>
